OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court charged with
OL,4,Amurdering his father after body
OL,5,Adiscovered in flat
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe appeared at Llandudno Magistrates'
OL,8,FCourt on Monday wearing a grey jumper
OL,9,Fand only spoke to confirm his name,
OL,10,Fdate of birth and that he understood
OL,11,Fthat his case was being transferred to
OL,12,Fthe crown court.
OL,14,FDistrict Judge Gwyn Jones told him he
OL,15,Fmust stay in custody and would next
OL,16,Fappear before Caernarfon Crown Court on
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
